# Optional model configuration. Basic build/ask/callers need no model.
# Never commit your real .env file or credentials.
# Deep uses the current Codex/Claude CLI and its existing login by default.
# Outside an agent terminal, select one explicitly:
# GRAFLY_AGENT_HOST=codex
# GRAFLY_PROVIDER=openai
# GRAFLY_MODEL=your-model-name
# GRAFLY_API_KEY=your-own-key
# GRAFLY_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
# GRAFLY_AMBIENT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1
# Automatic Brain mining also requires: grafly brain enable
